{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "b09c0e5458f7bd67a0386169fc08f23ddd36e4c4c19765e49834b4e7de2f3d40", "ja": "迷い色☆アンサンブル", "zh": "迷茫色彩☆合奏", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "42eea0ac31501730ee1c1d77e18a19f622b5980d61a2ed79edc9d3ac3482de6f", "ja": "奈緒に続き、今日は美奈子の衣装選び。その\n中で美奈子は、自分には個性がないのかも、\nと凹む。だがその本心は、仲間の奈緒に勝た\nなきゃいけない事への悩みだと気付いたプロ\nデューサーは、美奈子に発破をかける。", "zh": "继奈绪之后，今天轮到为美奈子挑选服装。其间\n美奈子陷入了沮丧，觉得自己或许没有个性。\n但看穿她其实是在为必须赢过同伴奈绪而烦恼后，\n制作人给美奈子鼓了鼓劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6598a3f78861ba4bc42c29c6f530ec836d901113284172e1b1ce7ecbbe492a0f", "ja": "（昨日に続いて、今日は美奈子の衣装選びだ。\nついて行こうかと恵美と歩は言ったのだが……）", "zh": "（继昨天之后，今天要帮美奈子挑选服装。惠美和步说想陪我一起去，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "88f15c1fd6f517655e409be0393882a1982bdb392074354f04901e10bbbfae4c", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n奈緒ちゃんの衣装は、もう選び終わったんですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n奈绪的服装，已经选好了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5411c22f56235d2c1d960251647ec22ed9c8a13669452125db28c5ebdf5fc561", "ja": "そうだな。奈緒も、最初はすごく悩んでたよ。\nそれで、まずはテーマを決めて……。", "zh": "是啊。奈绪一开始也纠结了很久。\n然后，先定下主题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c1ec3289e7b32dde02d9520ec2bed11844df021b00a655f4d344947073d85d52", "ja": "最終的には、歩と恵美のアドバイスもあって、\n納得のいくコーディネートができたみたいだ。", "zh": "最后，也有歩和恵美的建议，\n好像做出了令自己满意的搭配。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "1232a39e43848fbbd2d54d12567b6ca4f9cbfc3341da6f37ba8208ccb07a9521", "ja": "そうですか……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7e50113a49c510f7a0f584fd887bac6aad5139309d5d303b5dcc2bf96069f83d", "ja": "美奈子？　……やっぱり、歩か恵美に\nついてきてもらった方が良かったんじゃないか？", "zh": "美奈子？……果然还是该让步或者惠美陪你一起来的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "4feb9eb2561378c60f3b3f62cf897ac8dd9c3eb0e0d43ee9f73feccda9d97978", "ja": "あっ……いえ、大丈夫です！\nただ、私も、がんばらないとなーって考えてただけで！", "zh": "啊……不，没事的！\n我只是在想，我也得加把劲才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "c9e667e30e7f81e434606e72603394599e20842b4e09c1e871a4b2f08d184f0b", "ja": "あの、それでなんですけど……奈緒ちゃんの衣装の\nテーマは、{$P$}さんが決めたって。", "zh": "那个，我想问的是……听说奈绪的服装\n主题，是{$P$}先生定下来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4eb0e2725931260255b027d3cb21cc02b84f2eb3da4e9974b0bbecbf4845ca77", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。\n美奈子も、テーマを決めるか？", "zh": "啊，是的。\n美奈子也要来决定主题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "0dad2a2ced7179edcb1da5c350dd599285c9369b828056854ecdd93e726b893e", "ja": "はいっ、お願いします！", "zh": "好的，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9565eb944f764db81bab5ca886819cd008e7fa1a0aa7786f1d89dda0f965ffae", "ja": "美奈子ならそう言うんじゃないかと思って、\n編集さんに確認しておいたよ。", "zh": "我就猜到美奈子会这么说，所以已经跟编辑确认过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0d8d22f7be050d2ec99a36002436150b19fd8637ad0935c3bb2436e7da0f1a0a", "ja": "せっかくだし、奈緒と同じテーマでという事になった。\n『仲のいい友達と遊びに行く時に着たい服』だ！", "zh": "难得有这个机会，就决定和奈绪采用相同的主题。\n“和要好的朋友出去玩时想穿的服装”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "a1fcd2cbb03f83f01c6d4119827526e2d7b7f5b190dccc3a4b3c887767dfe5a0", "ja": "『仲のいい友達と遊びに行く時に着たい服』かぁ……\n遊びに行くなら、やっぱり動きやすい服装かな？", "zh": "“想和要好的朋友一起出去玩时穿的衣服”啊……\n要出去玩的话，果然还是方便活动的穿着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "a1e382266a6b77bdb23982393ef9266a6664067bdf4bf5d7958c1d918e98830c", "ja": "それに女の子同士って、服装とか髪型とか、\nけっこう細かいこだわりにも気がつくんですよね。", "zh": "而且女孩子之间也会注意到服装、发型之类相当细致的讲究呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "ccc6d92492f6dbaba2d2954fbccb21a9e04d9be18af92e97bd4462718cf3eccd", "ja": "ふんふん、なるほど……わかりました！\n何となくですけど、イメージが湧いてきました！", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来如此……明白了！\n虽然只是大概，但我已经有点头绪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "00222f0e28f41398cdecd76d8ec6b2d2918635bf9bb5de3b7e2efc92d3682230", "ja": "それは良かった！\nそれじゃ、早速向かおうか。", "zh": "那就太好了！\n那么，我们马上出发吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6c34db61f4a82ac2078ebbf7f62149d4f79dc5a43ea2e995d7a6e2359b49784f", "ja": "（歩と恵美がいないので、美奈子の衣装選びは\n現場のスタイリストさんが手伝ってくれる事になった）", "zh": "（因为步和惠美都不在，美奈子的服装选择就由现场的造型师来帮忙了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "396b42d9ecc7d7d4b792f985917c08010ace1c7b854bf044e65c7050493391f3", "ja": "普段より、すこしだけ大人っぽい感じにしたいんです。\nせっかく仲のいい友達と出かけるなら……。", "zh": "我想打扮得比平时稍微成熟一点点。\n难得和要好的朋友一起出门嘛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "f37d46f986050d260686e8935b3d6f330e25a23a84f26fdf3e9cb15f617b5642", "ja": "ひとりじゃ入れないようなオシャレなお店とか、\nたくさん見たいんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "像那种一个人不敢进去的时髦店之类的，我想多逛逛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1020_stylist", "source_sha256": "c3ba1fdd6b324478fe40b887154044e6b4d828d4d83d32d8d8ad868f2d8c55b4", "ja": "背伸びした感じですね、いいと思いますよ。\nオシャレは、憧れに近づこうとするものですし。", "zh": "有种强装成熟的感觉，我觉得很好哦。时尚，本来就是为了接近自己所憧憬的事物嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7ec4d2300152d2f645f91f96d012165087e20cad10c0db992e15937548a4601c", "ja": "（美奈子は自分の考えたイメージを一生懸命\n伝えている。スタイリストさんの感触も、いい感じだ）", "zh": "（美奈子正在努力传达自己构想的形象。造型师的反应也相当不错。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1022_stylist", "source_sha256": "b0d6b442eb1368e06196df7ae77af697d9ecdba17f55bae28271382dbb94814e", "ja": "このスカートはどうですか？　甘すぎないので、\nこっちのインナーと組み合わせると素敵かと！", "zh": "这条裙子怎么样？不会太甜，搭配这件内搭应该很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "0fb4753c399d500b6348d2eac3b9fcf6f288ae2774ac6319d901f5c469ee472a", "ja": "わあ～、かわいい！　けど……うーん。\nもうちょっとだけ、カジュアルなイメージがいいかも？", "zh": "哇～好可爱！不过……嗯——\n我觉得要是再稍微休闲一点，可能会更好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "68c72e9d4e092ba9db38845659bfbb040103dd1c3045813d51b7c7a8993fd87f", "ja": "あっ、このカットソー、かわいいですね！", "zh": "啊，这件针织衫好可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1025_stylist", "source_sha256": "6d7fcd52e34acfb37cf8180f20baaf5f5098ff09f21325ba610f4f1de0594c72", "ja": "そのインナーは、昨日奈緒ちゃんも選んでましたよ！\n最終的には、他のものにしてましたけど……。", "zh": "那件内搭，昨天奈绪也选过哦！  \n不过最后还是换成别的了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "9358730fee2892b61e7877d5ba81f6e064e498f8c091fe878f7dd2e6dd19f580", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　そう言われると、\n他のにした方がいい気がしてきちゃった……。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？你这么一说，\n我突然觉得还是换成别的比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "495eb55c1b0756df3da863d99e04da8be162aba40f8cbbd24754a44efecedb87", "ja": "衣装で、私の個性を出さないとなんですよね。\n個性……うう、よくわからなくなってきちゃった……。", "zh": "服装要能体现出我的个性才行。个性……唔，我越来越搞不清楚了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "4657cdac6db20b3a5d5f18c1c42e2e08a952539e6eebbd2ca14a94e1e03df9d2", "ja": "（慣れない仕事で、美奈子は少し焦っているみたいだ。\nここはいったん休憩して、落ち着いてもらおう）", "zh": "（美奈子似乎因为不熟悉这份工作而有些焦躁。先在这里休息一下，让她冷静下来吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "b7b476bae62791b6c9acaa40a3bd3d10b7dd8386c21883d79375d24e0358c8c7", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん……。\n私ってば、全然ダメでしたね……うぅ。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生……我真是完全不行呢……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4d3f5c3319f6f301d748fae073484bf34843caeb23d64fd971c8d0bebe7de487", "ja": "あれだけたくさん服があるんだし、美奈子が迷うのも\n仕方がないと思うよ。焦らず、ゆっくり選ぼう！", "zh": "衣服有那么多，美奈子会犹豫也是没办法的事。我觉得别着急，慢慢选就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "02fb38445398f98941b298d1b448a91079620bfbeb488d83f1bd46dca714f3a4", "ja": "はい。自分でも焦らないようにと思ってたんですけど、\nスタイリストさんの話を聞いてたら、なんだか……。", "zh": "是的，我自己也想着不能着急，可是听造型师说着说着，总觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "8986bfaf4dce325d01953ec47a744ea7d039f904a5b32521019b2090a7e4f60c", "ja": "私、自分の意見がないんだなって……。だったら、もう\n全部選んでもらったほうがいいんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "我发现自己根本没有自己的想法……既然这样，是不是让别人帮我全部选好算了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "092a857edf5966cff915f795d264ff0e67fe3add70d349084599245b788ac6ab", "ja": "美奈子……。", "zh": "美奈子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "9eae8ea6227d247340ebd9e6917639b65aaad151d1b71cfcb4d7c2c0ed17bd23", "ja": "それに……私がこのお仕事で活躍しようと思ったら、\n奈緒ちゃんに勝たなくちゃいけないんですよね？", "zh": "而且……如果我想在这份工作中大显身手，\n就必须赢过奈绪对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "a4ab55f516be1b6c7cd4b5499fd461eb65048c59f0936ec351bee62d890decef", "ja": "一緒にがんばろうって奈緒ちゃんは言ってくれたけど。\nでも、ふたりとも1位なんて、無理だと思うんです。", "zh": "奈绪说过要一起努力，可是……我觉得，两个人都拿到第1名，应该是不可能的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "dbe00cab00c844f10294343a795dce4d92f726f4800df9e381639c34f8ea4518", "ja": "歩ちゃんと恵美ちゃんが声をかけてくれたけど……\n私は、私だけで、がんばらなくちゃって……。", "zh": "步前辈和惠美都来跟我说过话，但是……\n我必须靠自己努力才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9c21aa4069924c4284ee99fe8fe7fb523532a3221a306c2594f117e2ef86030b", "ja": "（もしかしたら美奈子は、オーディションの時の事を\n思い出しているのかもしれない）", "zh": "（说不定美奈子是在回想试镜时的事）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "8090f07cdf80f819d6db1c22763fa0a687a7ebdcc148c47f0792b2ff9d1db710", "ja": "（だとしたら、『仲間に勝たなきゃいけない』という\n事実が、美奈子の気持ちを重くしているんだろう）", "zh": "（如果真是这样，那么“必须战胜伙伴”这一事实，应该让美奈子的心情变得沉重了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "58eda87280addcb900eb5f5c60cd79e542b8b2c7bf68cee47e40110ff02ef43a", "ja": "なら、諦めるか？", "zh": "那就放弃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1041_019min", "source_sha256": "114b48cd21969e42d51e2314db1fc92f240f45b31a824a9f8fdc5316c70b8be5", "ja": "えっ？　け、けど。", "zh": "诶？可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "ea05008142f67ba630a89fd1e5d2fc0be5b848b2cc34fb0db65abd21d48df9d8", "ja": "美奈子が降りるなら、チャンスは奈緒に行くだけだ。\nもっとも、奈緒が勝てるとは限らないけど……。", "zh": "如果美奈子退出，机会就只会落到奈绪手里。只不过，也不一定奈绪就能赢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1043_019min", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "f9bbd8907d898a1353c75d47c2cc82bdacb3c89b25826cea377f23321e7fc7ad", "ja": "これは俺の想像だけど。知らない相手に負けるより、\n仲間に負ける方が、ずっと悔しいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这只是我的猜想。比起输给不认识的人，输给伙伴，应该会更加不甘心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "a8f0febfcf3be0043fd7bbe8eacbbeb59aa4138f3d2333727513384754200fae", "ja": "仲間だからこそ、奈緒は全力で\n美奈子に挑んでくると思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得，正因为是伙伴，奈绪才会全力向美奈子发起挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1046_019min", "source_sha256": "63ce09668c9e58cf0042206c73d69746a71cb241ffa0be635a4a48d04b16f629", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nあの、私……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n那个，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "b11b758d48b1b358fa43effa991e6977464b04ad408cc91a727928bfc05b8612", "ja": "私、やります！　やる前からあきらめたりしたら、\n仲間に……奈緒ちゃんに、笑われちゃう！", "zh": "我要做！要是还没开始就放弃的话，\n伙伴们……奈绪她会笑话我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "25815b7791310cc0fac8ac7d1db6ffcba2ab466a439a00d1bc10b36f5f460814", "ja": "そうだな。それじゃ、戻ろうか。今ならきっと、\n美奈子に一番似合う服が、選べると思う。", "zh": "是啊。那我们回去吧。现在的话，我一定能选出最适合美奈子的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1049_019min", "source_sha256": "6ca8700bfad2ba1647ff1aeccc07a01271fa5156c9b716c1e435f32a8189e85c", "ja": "{$P$}さん……、\nはいっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……，\n好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1051_019min", "source_sha256": "55d1e275fdd3116ffec94b39fc1e83434728dfc468808eba68da8732edb29559", "ja": "休憩終わりました！　すみませんっ！\n……あの、このトップスって、違う色はありますか？", "zh": "休息结束了！不好意思！\n……那个，这件上衣还有其他颜色吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1052_stylist", "source_sha256": "41ad222246c59743328467a3eeeb9baeb448a24466f22d21c03b21d909147a20", "ja": "これは、あと2色ありますよ。\n美奈子ちゃんに似合う色なら……こっちかな？", "zh": "这还有2种颜色哦。\n要是选适合美奈子的颜色……应该是这个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1053_019min", "source_sha256": "13420a278059cf667715f68308e7db02bc48fd3978eadbe57a33e4943fe562a9", "ja": "わっ、キレイ！　じゃあ、とりあえずこれをキープして\n……あとは、ブラウスも見せてもらっていいですか！？", "zh": "哇，好漂亮！那先暂定这件……\n然后，衬衫也能拿给我看一下吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1054_p", "source_sha256": "62146ed333827a13cc9952008b56ef1006e00d31e8db91da7c28594550d8ded3", "ja": "（美奈子はスタイリストさんに、熱心に質問している。\n迷いがあっても、進むと決められたんだろう）", "zh": "（美奈子正在认真地向造型师提问。看来即使心中有所迷茫，她也已经决定要继续前进了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "c098e982908fba29a9729979853f514c3dbf928262edc992994e9a6e8016d2fe", "ja": "（この感じならきっと、大丈夫だ。\n撮影が楽しみだな……！）", "zh": "（照这个样子，肯定没问题。真期待拍摄啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
